WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Fart fire bakes snow

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,640
How is it possible that the more you bake it, the stronger it becomes?

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,720
Is this untrue?

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,660
God

5
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,100
Really, really become stronger

6
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,980
You only see cremation snow

7
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:15,850
Didn't you see the snow water gone? This roof

8
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:21,450
I deliberately dug it into an arched dome. Did you notice that it is round? What's the explanation? The fire started.

9
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:22,850
The snow wall near the fire

10
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,210
It will indeed turn into water

11
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:25,730
But the water won't drip down

12
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:27,570
Because the top is round and slanted

13
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:30,010
Water will flow down along the arc-shaped inner wall

14
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:34,090
It flows all the way down, getting colder and colder as it goes down. As it flows, it starts to move again.

15
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:37,130
It moved into a layer of hard ice. This layer of ice is layered one on top of the other.

16
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:39,890
I left the entire igloo alone to death, so

17
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,060
The fire is not burning the house

18
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,340
The fire is for this house

19
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,100
Layer by layer of ice reinforcement
